      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/sedgwick_arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "George Sedgwick donated land and materials for a schoolhouse in 1894, where Dora Smith became the first teacher.",
